WEBVTT

00:00:11.170 --> 00:00:12.920
Twenty seconds to impact!

00:00:13.010 --> 00:00:15.180
The number of fragments keeps increasing.

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:18.180
The five of them
are heading to the moored shuttle.

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:20.430
The shuttle area is decompressing.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.930
Maintain pressure until they evacuate!

00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:30.190
-What happened to the shuttle?
-The radar is blank. I can't tell.

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:32.690
We'll run out of air in here soon too.

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:34.490
Abandon the control room.

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:38.410
All crew, move to the sub-control room!

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:41.790
4 HOURS, 42 MINUTES, 30 SECONDS
AFTER ACCIDENT

00:00:41.870 --> 00:00:45.460
The comet fragments are still going around
at the same altitude.

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:48.170
This is probably an AI comet.

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:50.040
An AI comet?

00:00:50.130 --> 00:00:52.840
Yeah.
An unmanned vehicle is sent to the comet

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:55.840
and sprays out a micro machine
that self-propagates

00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:59.430
and automatically creates
a membrane-like computer and engine.

00:00:59.510 --> 00:01:04.230
The AI does everything,
so it's cheaper than lunar water.

00:01:04.770 --> 00:01:06.690
-Mayor?
-What?

00:01:06.770 --> 00:01:08.190
This is bad.

00:01:08.270 --> 00:01:12.070
The second orbit of the comet group
is coming!

00:01:12.150 --> 00:01:13.190
Hold on!

00:01:14.280 --> 00:01:15.990
5 HOURS, 21 MINUTES, 10 SECONDS
AFTER ACCIDENT

00:01:16.070 --> 00:01:17.200
Any damage?

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:20.780
Looks like we still have air.

00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:22.700
Mayor.

00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:24.290
What is that?

00:01:24.790 --> 00:01:26.710
Touya, are you safe?

00:01:26.790 --> 00:01:28.290
Uncle!

00:01:28.370 --> 00:01:32.500
Touya, you have to survive long enough
for the UN2 rescue ship to come.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:34.210
We will.

00:01:35.050 --> 00:01:36.720
Just a little longer, guys.

00:01:37.300 --> 00:01:39.220
We're going to solve the problem.

00:01:40.050 --> 00:01:41.470
It's what you said, but…

00:01:41.550 --> 00:01:42.760
EPISODE 4: SEVEN'S PATTERN

00:01:42.850 --> 00:01:44.810
We have to open the bulkheads above

00:01:44.890 --> 00:01:48.230
to be able to get on the UN2 rescue ship.

00:01:48.940 --> 00:01:50.270
Connected.

00:01:50.940 --> 00:01:53.730
Okay.
With this, we can always communicate.

00:01:53.820 --> 00:01:57.780
I'm not sure if it will work well or not,
but I have an idea.

00:01:57.860 --> 00:01:59.070
Dakky.

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:03.490
Even if Twelve can't do it,

00:02:03.580 --> 00:02:06.580
we might be able to reboot
with a separate system.

00:02:08.960 --> 00:02:12.500
A while back, I hacked
a security hole in the bird drones.

00:02:12.590 --> 00:02:15.050
When on earth did you do that?

00:02:15.130 --> 00:02:16.130
Align.

00:02:18.380 --> 00:02:20.140
All right, get in formation.

00:02:21.340 --> 00:02:22.510
Forward.

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:26.640
You in front, more to the right.

00:02:28.140 --> 00:02:30.400
Hacking is a major violation of the rules.

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:32.770
Shall I stop the reboot then?

00:02:33.690 --> 00:02:35.900
No. Carry on.

00:02:36.610 --> 00:02:40.160
All right. It looks like the lower system
can be restored right away.

00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:42.570
If I fiddle with this,
communications will be restored.

00:02:42.660 --> 00:02:44.660
The birds were drones?

00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:50.290
Communications have been restored.

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:52.500
What a terrifying nephew you have.

00:02:52.580 --> 00:02:54.920
Touya,
are you able to access the bulkhead?

00:02:57.010 --> 00:02:58.420
No, we can't get in.

00:02:58.510 --> 00:03:00.800
Some things work and some don't.

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:02.300
How are they different?

00:03:02.390 --> 00:03:03.640
I don't know,

00:03:03.720 --> 00:03:06.930
but the things that aren't working
are those that incorporate quantum AI.

00:03:08.430 --> 00:03:10.640
The net's back!

00:03:14.110 --> 00:03:16.070
Mina, everybody!

00:03:16.150 --> 00:03:17.690
I'm still alive.

00:03:17.780 --> 00:03:21.700
What? "Everybody around the world
is relaying the Mina broadcast"?

00:03:21.780 --> 00:03:23.450
I'm world-famous?

00:03:23.530 --> 00:03:24.530
IN THE RANKING

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:26.200
Thirty million followers?

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:28.700
Yay! One-third of my goal.

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:30.960
I've conquered worldwide.
Next is universe-wide.

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:31.960
FOLLOWERS

00:03:33.040 --> 00:03:35.040
Another failure.

00:03:35.130 --> 00:03:37.800
-I'm sorry.
-If you make a mistake, you can try again.

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:38.960
Yeah.

00:03:39.050 --> 00:03:42.470
But a mistake in space could be deadly,
so I'll be careful.

00:03:42.550 --> 00:03:46.510
True. But the most dangerous thing
isn't making a mistake.

00:03:46.600 --> 00:03:49.390
Giving up after making a mistake
is the most dangerous.

00:03:49.470 --> 00:03:50.480
Right.

00:03:50.560 --> 00:03:53.230
Today's Hero Interview.

00:03:53.310 --> 00:03:56.730
This is the famous Touya,
universally renowned.

00:03:56.810 --> 00:03:59.030
Touya, how do you feel?

00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:00.110
Shut up.

00:04:00.190 --> 00:04:03.240
There you have it.
Universally nasty as always.

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:07.870
By the way, Touya,
you call your partner drone Dakky,

00:04:07.950 --> 00:04:09.950
but what is its formal name?

00:04:10.620 --> 00:04:11.870
Darkness Killer.

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:15.380
Did you just laugh?

00:04:15.830 --> 00:04:18.590
No way. It's a cool name.

00:04:18.670 --> 00:04:21.130
That's why its nickname is Dakky,
isn't it?

00:04:21.210 --> 00:04:22.510
Go away!

00:04:22.590 --> 00:04:25.180
-You're in the way, Earther!
-You're in the way, Earther!

00:04:25.260 --> 00:04:27.350
If you open up this pathway--

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:29.060
What are you eating?

00:04:29.140 --> 00:04:31.850
-Shut up, Earther!
-Shut up, Earther!

00:04:32.430 --> 00:04:33.810
Favorite word?

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:36.940
-Drop dead, Earther!
-Drop dead, Earther!

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:38.560
What are you doing?

00:04:38.650 --> 00:04:41.650
-You're an Earther too, you know!
-Just go away!

00:04:41.730 --> 00:04:43.360
Don't bother Touya!

00:04:43.440 --> 00:04:45.070
Fine, whatever.

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:47.990
-I got loads of usable footage.
-A meteorite should be dropped on Earth

00:04:48.070 --> 00:04:50.580
and should reduce
Earth's population by one-third.

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:54.790
-Drop dead, Earther!
-I'll gather all of these and up they go.

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:56.120
SHOCKING! TOUYA'S TRUE COLORS

00:04:56.210 --> 00:04:59.040
There. The details
of our current time line are displaying.

00:04:59.130 --> 00:05:00.130
SIGNAL 22%

00:05:00.210 --> 00:05:01.630
UN2?

00:05:01.710 --> 00:05:03.880
The UN2 signal's coming in.

00:05:03.970 --> 00:05:06.510
The UN2 rescue ship
is currently approaching.

00:05:06.590 --> 00:05:09.010
It will rendezvous with the Anshin
in one hour.

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:12.310
-It's UN2. UN2 has come.
-Yes!

00:05:12.390 --> 00:05:14.060
Yes, we're saved!

00:05:14.140 --> 00:05:16.140
Just what you'd expect
of humanity's representatives.

00:05:16.230 --> 00:05:17.650
They didn't forget about us.

00:05:17.730 --> 00:05:19.940
-All right.
-What's up?

00:05:20.020 --> 00:05:22.650
The timelines have converged.
It won't be long now.

00:05:23.320 --> 00:05:25.530
Text-only communication
has been established.

00:05:25.610 --> 00:05:28.070
What's happening with the comet?

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:31.120
The fragments from the comet
that collided with the Anshin

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:32.870
have scattered around a wide area

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:35.620
and are burning up and evaporating
in the atmosphere.

00:05:35.710 --> 00:05:37.330
The danger is subsiding.

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:41.040
However, this says that there is
a risk of contact with the Anshin

00:05:41.130 --> 00:05:42.340
in the next few hours.

00:05:42.420 --> 00:05:45.340
An exact match
with the Anshin's orbital plane?

00:05:45.420 --> 00:05:47.430
How is such a coincidence possible?

00:05:47.510 --> 00:05:48.510
There's more.

00:05:48.590 --> 00:05:51.300
However, aside from the other things
that entered low orbit,

00:05:51.390 --> 00:05:56.730
Alpha, the large, main body
is about to collide with Earth again.

00:05:56.810 --> 00:05:58.060
COMET 88%

00:05:58.140 --> 00:05:59.310
NUCLEAR ATTACK 87%

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:00.980
A nuclear attack?

00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:05.070
UN2 will soon be carrying out
a second nuclear strike on Alpha.

00:06:05.150 --> 00:06:08.650
If that happens, the EMP will destroy the
electrical equipment on the rescue ship

00:06:08.740 --> 00:06:10.530
and won't carry out the rescue.

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:12.580
You have to escape before that happens.

00:06:12.660 --> 00:06:15.240
Everything-- both reacceleration
and opening the bulkhead--

00:06:15.330 --> 00:06:17.960
all hinges upon rebooting Twelve.

00:06:18.040 --> 00:06:21.080
I'm sorry to ask this of you civilians,
but help us.

00:06:21.170 --> 00:06:24.340
Touya, would you be able
to reboot Twelve with Dakky

00:06:24.420 --> 00:06:26.630
using that security hole from before?

00:06:26.710 --> 00:06:29.300
That would be difficult
with Dakky's current cognition level.

00:06:29.380 --> 00:06:31.340
What about your drone?

00:06:31.430 --> 00:06:34.760
Bright was not made to be used
for those kinds of rules violations.

00:06:34.850 --> 00:06:36.930
Then there is one way.

00:06:37.020 --> 00:06:40.230
Unlock up to the C limiter
of Dakky's cognitive restrictions.

00:06:40.310 --> 00:06:41.900
No way!

00:06:41.980 --> 00:06:45.190
Taiyou, I'm counting on you.
I will take responsibility.

00:06:45.780 --> 00:06:47.780
We don't know what will happen.

00:06:47.860 --> 00:06:49.650
-Bright.
-Aye. Copy.

00:06:54.580 --> 00:06:55.740
Do it, Dakky.

00:06:59.870 --> 00:07:01.920
All right. Good job, Dakky.

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:05.250
I never thought I would end up
having a hand in such illegal activity.

00:07:08.090 --> 00:07:09.260
It booted up.

00:07:11.340 --> 00:07:15.260
I am Deegle's advanced general purpose AI,
Twelve.

00:07:15.350 --> 00:07:18.470
Twelve was made for the prosperity
and development of human--

00:07:18.560 --> 00:07:20.440
-Twelve, shut up.
-Shutting up.

00:07:20.520 --> 00:07:23.150
Twelve, open the blockage
in the B Cylinder.

00:07:23.230 --> 00:07:25.310
Secure oxygen
for the passage through here.

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:28.780
Initializing air pressure modification
for the passage from B Cylinder.

00:07:29.360 --> 00:07:31.650
Touya, the bulkhead is opening.

00:07:31.740 --> 00:07:32.660
MINA 81%

00:07:32.740 --> 00:07:35.700
-Mina?
-It has started hitting individuals.

00:07:35.780 --> 00:07:36.780
CLOSE 92%

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:39.120
Hey! Where are you going?

00:07:39.200 --> 00:07:41.870
This is another chance
to increase my followers!

00:07:41.960 --> 00:07:45.040
What are you doing, you LoserTuber?

00:07:46.170 --> 00:07:48.550
Nasa, what is that app?

00:07:48.630 --> 00:07:50.170
Oh, well…

00:07:50.260 --> 00:07:53.300
Is that the Seven Poem prophecy
you've always talked about?

00:07:53.380 --> 00:07:54.640
Yes.

00:07:54.720 --> 00:07:58.680
Actually, it's an app that analyzes the
poem and displays future possibilities.

00:07:58.760 --> 00:08:01.310
Does this mean that Mina
is going to get trapped over there?

00:08:01.390 --> 00:08:02.310
EROSION 84%

00:08:02.390 --> 00:08:04.600
-Oh, no.
-Wait.

00:08:04.690 --> 00:08:05.810
But--

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:09.320
Mina's reaching the top.

00:08:11.900 --> 00:08:13.650
Why is it closing?

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:16.200
Twelve, what's wrong? Don't close it.

00:08:17.070 --> 00:08:20.200
-Why did you stop me?
-It would disturb the timeline.

00:08:21.370 --> 00:08:25.210
If we told them, the future
that Seven predicted would change.

00:08:25.290 --> 00:08:26.210
Nasa.

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:29.130
Can you see what's happening inside?

00:08:29.210 --> 00:08:32.010
No.
I can't access the surveillance camera.

00:08:32.090 --> 00:08:33.630
I found her.

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:37.390
I'm going to make this into a story
and increase my followers.

00:08:37.470 --> 00:08:38.470
FAKE?

00:08:38.550 --> 00:08:40.390
Mina, everybody!

00:08:40.470 --> 00:08:42.890
Twelve, open the bulkhead.

00:08:42.980 --> 00:08:47.610
I've lost the control function
for each of the panels.

00:08:47.690 --> 00:08:49.320
What does that mean?

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:51.780
Report the location of function loss.

00:08:51.860 --> 00:08:54.110
Most of it is around the A Cylinder.

00:08:55.360 --> 00:08:56.530
What is this?

00:08:56.610 --> 00:09:00.490
Nasa, hasn't it predicted a way
to open the bulkhead?

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:03.540
This doesn't really work like that.

00:09:04.460 --> 00:09:05.540
The "S" Pattern?

00:09:06.120 --> 00:09:09.040
The "S" Pattern is growing.

00:09:09.130 --> 00:09:11.000
That pattern--

00:09:11.090 --> 00:09:14.220
It's the same
as the surface of the comet that crashed.

00:09:14.300 --> 00:09:17.300
The area in the pattern
matches the area we've lost control of.

00:09:17.390 --> 00:09:18.970
Is that the cause?

00:09:19.050 --> 00:09:23.140
It's the micro machine
that forms the quantum AI of the comet.

00:09:23.220 --> 00:09:26.190
Has it mistaken the station
for the comet it's attached to?

00:09:26.270 --> 00:09:29.610
That is unknown. However,
it is possible that this abnormal growth

00:09:29.690 --> 00:09:33.190
means that some kind of modification
has been made.

00:09:33.280 --> 00:09:35.950
Everything that's happened has been
predicted frighteningly accurately.

00:09:36.030 --> 00:09:36.950
TWELVE 97%

00:09:37.610 --> 00:09:38.700
Twelve?

00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:41.280
Is this some kind of hacking?

00:09:41.370 --> 00:09:42.490
That is unclear,

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:47.750
but it is indiscriminately hacking
nearby devices and trying to assimilate--

00:09:49.170 --> 00:09:51.460
-Twelve?
-What happened, Twelve?

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:53.300
My apologies.

00:09:53.380 --> 00:09:57.010
In 13 minutes, 11 seconds, I will die.

00:09:57.930 --> 00:10:01.680
I am currently being exposed to erosion.

00:10:01.760 --> 00:10:03.850
There is one way to stop the erosion.

00:10:03.930 --> 00:10:06.480
We'll help. What do we need to do?

00:10:06.560 --> 00:10:11.230
Give me permission to further unlock
the cognitive limiters of Touya's drone.

00:10:11.310 --> 00:10:12.320
What?

00:10:13.070 --> 00:10:14.070
-GOSH
-SHE'S TRAPPED

00:10:14.150 --> 00:10:18.110
In terms of intelligence, only that AI
is capable of correcting the situation.

00:10:18.200 --> 00:10:22.070
-I went inside, and the door just closed.
-My sister is making such a mess!

00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:24.700
-It's not my fault.
-I'm so, so--

00:10:24.790 --> 00:10:27.790
Papa-- I mean, Dad.

00:10:28.290 --> 00:10:31.000
Yeah? I'm kind of busy right now.

00:10:31.920 --> 00:10:34.630
Don't tell me. Tell Mina.

00:10:36.760 --> 00:10:38.720
It still won't open.

00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:40.680
I'm stuck.

00:10:41.720 --> 00:10:42.640
MOTHER

00:10:42.720 --> 00:10:43.640
Mom?

00:10:44.220 --> 00:10:47.270
What? Why are you calling out of the blue?

00:10:48.770 --> 00:10:51.770
I'm in the middle of a broadcast.
I'm hanging up.

00:10:53.310 --> 00:10:54.400
What's this?

00:10:54.480 --> 00:10:58.610
Air pressure adjustment function
has just shut down.

00:10:58.690 --> 00:10:59.780
This is bad.

00:10:59.860 --> 00:11:00.950
"Wa-nin"?

00:11:01.030 --> 00:11:02.030
WILL BE SUFFOCATED

00:11:02.110 --> 00:11:04.330
Does anyone know what this means?

00:11:04.410 --> 00:11:06.290
-NO OXYGEN
-THIS IS MOM

00:11:06.370 --> 00:11:08.330
"Death by suffocation."

00:11:08.410 --> 00:11:09.540
What?

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:13.000
I got it on!

00:11:13.670 --> 00:11:16.380
Now I can breathe the oxygen
in the space suit.

00:11:16.460 --> 00:11:17.460
What?

00:11:17.550 --> 00:11:18.550
Yikes!

00:11:18.630 --> 00:11:20.550
This is out of oxygen too!

00:11:20.630 --> 00:11:23.930
I used it all up in the EVA from before!

00:11:24.010 --> 00:11:26.310
Taiyou, please give me permission.

00:11:26.390 --> 00:11:29.350
The authority of a UN2 staff member
is required.

00:11:29.430 --> 00:11:30.430
But--

00:11:30.520 --> 00:11:34.150
This is bad! I'm really going to die now!

00:11:34.900 --> 00:11:35.900
FATHER

00:11:35.980 --> 00:11:37.570
Now it's Dad?

00:11:37.650 --> 00:11:40.650
Didn't I tell you not to call
in the middle of a broadcast?

00:11:40.740 --> 00:11:41.740
-NO GOOD
-STORY?

00:11:41.820 --> 00:11:42.910
I'll die?

00:11:42.990 --> 00:11:46.330
No, I won't die.
It's a story. I'm hanging up.

00:11:46.410 --> 00:11:47.950
-THIS IS MINA'S FATHER
-MINA'S MOTHER (FOR REAL)

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:49.950
My parents are texting.

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:52.710
In front of the entire world--
My family is disgracing itself.

00:11:52.790 --> 00:11:54.080
CHECK KASUMIGAURA OFFICE HP!

00:11:54.170 --> 00:11:56.380
"John Doe claimed responsibility"?

00:11:56.790 --> 00:11:57.800
KASUMIGAURA OFFICE

00:11:57.880 --> 00:12:00.670
Taiyou, Mina is going to die. Hurry!

00:12:00.760 --> 00:12:06.100
Personally, mixing black into white
is absolutely unforgivable.

00:12:06.180 --> 00:12:07.850
What are you talking about?

00:12:07.930 --> 00:12:10.100
I'll permit the unlocking of the limiters.

00:12:10.180 --> 00:12:11.390
However,

00:12:11.480 --> 00:12:14.310
before that, I'm going to frame-fuse
Dakky and Bright together.

00:12:14.400 --> 00:12:15.270
What?

00:12:15.860 --> 00:12:19.110
I'll allow it on the condition
that it be managed by Bright.

00:12:19.190 --> 00:12:20.440
Wait a minute!

00:12:20.530 --> 00:12:24.110
I'll never forgive
mixing white into black.

00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:25.280
Execute.

00:12:26.870 --> 00:12:28.950
Frame fusion!

00:12:31.370 --> 00:12:32.790
I'll be right back.

00:12:35.620 --> 00:12:36.750
"Incorporation"?

00:12:39.340 --> 00:12:41.510
Frame fusion!

00:12:41.590 --> 00:12:44.010
What is frame fusion?

00:12:44.090 --> 00:12:45.630
-Incorporation.
-Incorporation.

00:12:45.720 --> 00:12:46.640
SAVE HER

00:12:46.720 --> 00:12:48.140
Hurry! Hurry up and save me!

00:12:48.220 --> 00:12:51.100
My follower count has grown. I'm so happy.

00:12:51.180 --> 00:12:53.140
Save me!

00:12:53.230 --> 00:12:56.020
IT IS FUTILE TO RESIST
THE PASSAGE OF TIME

00:12:56.100 --> 00:12:57.730
Resistance is futile.

00:12:57.810 --> 00:13:01.610
Dark, you will be reassigned
under my supervision.

00:13:05.780 --> 00:13:08.740
We have incorporated into a single frame.

00:13:08.820 --> 00:13:11.660
We are, so to speak, Dark-Bright.

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:15.540
Dark has already been unlocked
up to the C limiter.

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:16.960
If the E limiter is unlocked,

00:13:17.040 --> 00:13:19.460
we should achieve the intelligence
to suppress the erosion.

00:13:19.540 --> 00:13:20.540
I permit it.

00:13:20.630 --> 00:13:22.590
E limiter unlocked.

00:13:23.510 --> 00:13:25.840
Dark's cognitive level
is currently surging.

00:13:25.930 --> 00:13:28.640
Now, Dark,
show us what you are capable of.

00:13:33.390 --> 00:13:36.310
All right. It looks like
we should be able to eliminate it.

00:13:39.230 --> 00:13:40.900
Something's here!

00:13:40.980 --> 00:13:43.820
How come it's eroding all the way inside?

00:13:43.900 --> 00:13:46.070
Look! It's coming in here too.

00:13:49.070 --> 00:13:50.950
In this state,
it won't have enough capacity.

00:13:51.030 --> 00:13:53.160
Unlock a higher level
of cognitive restrictions.

00:13:53.240 --> 00:13:56.040
I hate doing things like this.

00:13:56.120 --> 00:13:57.960
We need to get up to the G limiter.

00:13:58.040 --> 00:13:59.040
Permission granted.

00:14:07.090 --> 00:14:08.970
It seems the obstacle can be eliminated.

00:14:09.050 --> 00:14:10.970
Accessing the bulkhead.

00:14:13.560 --> 00:14:15.850
I thought I was a goner.

00:14:15.930 --> 00:14:19.350
I am so sorry for the trouble
my older sister has caused.

00:14:19.440 --> 00:14:21.860
Taiyou. Touya.

00:14:21.940 --> 00:14:23.650
You guys saved my life.

00:14:23.730 --> 00:14:26.030
I'll give you
5,000 Mina handshake coupons.

00:14:26.110 --> 00:14:27.360
Not necessary.

00:14:27.440 --> 00:14:28.820
Oh, yeah.

00:14:28.900 --> 00:14:31.870
I should introduce
Touya and everybody to my followers.

00:14:31.950 --> 00:14:33.200
SHOCKING! TOUYA'S TRUE COLORS

00:14:33.280 --> 00:14:34.410
Oops, forgot.

00:14:34.910 --> 00:14:37.660
I should delete that video.

00:14:37.750 --> 00:14:38.830
What?

00:14:39.420 --> 00:14:40.960
The Internet's out.

00:14:41.040 --> 00:14:42.710
Oh, no. I can't delete it.

00:14:47.670 --> 00:14:50.130
All right, just one more bulkhead.

00:14:50.720 --> 00:14:52.140
Twelve, hurry up.

00:14:56.770 --> 00:14:58.270
Twelve, what's wrong?

00:14:58.350 --> 00:15:00.350
Everyone, time's up.

00:15:01.730 --> 00:15:04.020
I will die now.

00:15:04.110 --> 00:15:06.900
-Farewell.
-Wait, Twelve.

00:15:07.650 --> 00:15:10.740
I hope I was able
to meet the expectations all of you--

00:15:10.820 --> 00:15:11.910
Twelve!

00:15:11.990 --> 00:15:15.410
Touya,
why isn't the last bulkhead opening?

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:17.950
Twelve

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:20.290
is dead.

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:23.500
The squiggly wigglies are spreading again.

00:15:30.260 --> 00:15:32.090
The pattern is evolving.

00:15:32.180 --> 00:15:34.640
Stopping it here
will be the best I can do.

00:15:34.720 --> 00:15:35.850
It's the UN2.

00:15:35.930 --> 00:15:38.350
The UN2 ship has come.

00:15:38.430 --> 00:15:39.520
We're saved!

00:15:39.600 --> 00:15:42.270
The UN2 rescue ship has come, everybody.

00:15:42.350 --> 00:15:45.110
What a relief! UN2!

00:15:45.190 --> 00:15:46.860
UN2!

00:15:48.150 --> 00:15:49.070
ATTACK VESSEL 94%

00:15:49.150 --> 00:15:50.440
An attack vessel?

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:52.910
Why aren't the comms back?

00:15:52.990 --> 00:15:56.830
I don't know, but text-only communication
is just barely possible.

00:15:56.910 --> 00:15:58.080
I'll read it.

00:15:58.580 --> 00:16:02.830
"Because this station
could potentially trigger a pandemic,

00:16:02.920 --> 00:16:04.330
we are sealing it off."

00:16:04.420 --> 00:16:05.830
That's not a rescue ship.

00:16:06.420 --> 00:16:07.710
It's an attack vessel.

00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:10.090
UN2. No.

00:16:10.170 --> 00:16:13.550
Why are they doing this? Because
I unlocked the cognitive restrictions?

00:16:13.630 --> 00:16:15.050
A pandemic?

00:16:15.140 --> 00:16:17.050
-Like a disease?
-It's probably that.

00:16:17.640 --> 00:16:21.060
They're afraid that it will spread
outside of the station.

00:16:22.140 --> 00:16:26.060
But this is just the time
to ride this big wave.

00:16:26.650 --> 00:16:29.780
-UN2, Please!
-Here's the recap up to this point.

00:16:29.860 --> 00:16:33.400
A comet hit us. We are trapped.
The guy has **** lost it!

00:16:33.490 --> 00:16:37.030
A creepy pattern is eroding the place,
and UN2 is not going to save us!

00:16:37.120 --> 00:16:39.580
In a single word, it is chaos!

00:16:39.660 --> 00:16:41.080
On the scene and signing off.

00:16:41.160 --> 00:16:44.290
UN2 is the one blocking the comms?

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:46.670
Do they intend to abandon the children?

00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:48.840
They're saying the pattern
on the Anshin's surface

00:16:48.920 --> 00:16:52.670
matches the forbidden "S" Pattern.

00:16:52.760 --> 00:16:55.470
"S" Pattern? What does that mean?

00:16:56.050 --> 00:16:59.100
The "S" Pattern
is a dangerous quantum circuit

00:16:59.180 --> 00:17:01.970
that transcended human technology
and self-propagates.

00:17:03.480 --> 00:17:05.390
Self-propagates? Impossible.

00:17:05.480 --> 00:17:08.560
There's an even bigger one over there.

00:17:09.480 --> 00:17:10.400
DELICIOUS COMET WATER

00:17:10.480 --> 00:17:12.280
The system that restores the comet

00:17:12.360 --> 00:17:16.160
was a product designed by Seven
right before it was euthanized.

00:17:16.740 --> 00:17:18.740
It was made with the "S" Pattern.

00:17:19.830 --> 00:17:22.660
It's finally begun.
The final chapter of the poem.

00:17:22.750 --> 00:17:26.170
I'll read it.
"Since the Lunatic Seven incident,

00:17:26.250 --> 00:17:29.080
all 'S' Patterns were supposed
to have been destroyed.

00:17:29.170 --> 00:17:31.800
However, part of it
somehow eluded surveillance."

00:17:32.630 --> 00:17:35.300
Yes, Konoha's
and the others' implants too.

00:17:36.130 --> 00:17:39.640
"Now all existing 'S' Patterns
around the world

00:17:39.720 --> 00:17:41.220
are on the comet and on this station.

00:17:41.310 --> 00:17:42.310
S PATTERN - JOHN DOE

00:17:42.390 --> 00:17:43.810
This is too unnatural.

00:17:44.480 --> 00:17:46.770
This is part of
an intentional act of terrorism.

00:17:47.560 --> 00:17:51.230
We believe that a collaborator
is inside the Anshin.

00:17:52.440 --> 00:17:54.780
Earlier,
someone from John Doe made a statement

00:17:54.860 --> 00:17:57.200
claiming responsibility for the offense."

00:17:57.780 --> 00:17:59.320
A statement from John Doe?

00:17:59.410 --> 00:18:02.830
Oh, that thing from before
that I read by chance.

00:18:03.410 --> 00:18:07.080
"The White House, Shenzhen,
the Kremlin, Kasumigaura and the like,

00:18:07.160 --> 00:18:09.210
all of their home pages
are being rewritten."

00:18:09.290 --> 00:18:13.300
They're confusing
Kasumigaura and Kasumigaseki again.

00:18:13.380 --> 00:18:15.630
One third of humankind--

00:18:15.710 --> 00:18:17.720
I've heard that somewhere.

00:18:18.380 --> 00:18:21.220
But how could they do something
so terrible?

00:18:22.430 --> 00:18:24.720
It's the main body of the comet.

00:18:25.180 --> 00:18:28.140
They plan on hitting Earth with the comet.

00:18:29.810 --> 00:18:33.440
In one hour, the planet will take
a direct hit from the comet.

00:18:33.520 --> 00:18:36.740
This is the mass of the main body,
as analyzed by the UN2.

00:18:37.320 --> 00:18:39.740
If something like this hits Earth--

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:51.210
It coincides perfectly with Seven's plan
to exterminate 36.79% of humanity.

00:18:52.290 --> 00:18:54.590
We've determined
what type of attack vessel it is.

00:18:55.300 --> 00:18:57.090
It's compatible with nuclear weapons.

00:18:57.800 --> 00:19:00.630
They think that we're part of John Doe.

00:19:01.180 --> 00:19:02.090
OPTICAL

00:19:02.180 --> 00:19:05.100
Is the UN2 planning a nuclear strike
on us as well?

00:19:05.180 --> 00:19:07.180
I won't allow it.

00:19:07.270 --> 00:19:08.270
Think.

00:19:14.150 --> 00:19:17.030
The pattern's intelligence
is also surging.

00:19:17.730 --> 00:19:19.320
Unlock the J limiter.

00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:20.400
Permission granted.

00:19:22.410 --> 00:19:23.410
It's still not enough.

00:19:23.950 --> 00:19:25.910
Granted. Full permissions granted.

00:19:25.990 --> 00:19:30.870
Taiyou, with your authority,
I can only unlock up to the L limiter.

00:19:32.370 --> 00:19:34.790
Then grant permission up to the L limiter.

00:19:36.000 --> 00:19:38.170
It seems the erosion has stopped.

00:19:39.460 --> 00:19:44.180
Somehow the quantum circuit was completed,
so it seems the growth phase has ended.

00:19:44.760 --> 00:19:47.390
I've got to think
even more outside the box.

00:19:48.930 --> 00:19:52.060
The comet is just 20,000 kilometers away.

00:19:52.140 --> 00:19:53.850
If a nuclear explosion occurs here,

00:19:53.940 --> 00:19:57.190
the rescue ship that's supposed to come
before it enters the atmosphere

00:19:57.270 --> 00:20:00.610
will also be completely inoperable due to
the electromagnetic waves from the EMPs.

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:05.280
If we don't stop UN2 from
a nuclear strike, we'll all be Buddhas.

00:20:05.370 --> 00:20:07.660
There's one way to stop them.

00:20:07.740 --> 00:20:10.000
Eliminate the threat of the comet.

00:20:10.080 --> 00:20:11.120
How?

00:20:11.710 --> 00:20:13.540
Stop the collision with Earth.

00:20:14.120 --> 00:20:16.340
And how will we do that?

00:20:16.420 --> 00:20:18.710
Convince it not to?

00:20:21.220 --> 00:20:22.380
That's right.

00:20:22.470 --> 00:20:26.430
The water company would have been prepared
to correct a deviation from orbit.

00:20:26.510 --> 00:20:29.600
I see. Getting the materials now.

00:20:30.560 --> 00:20:33.100
Can we communicate with the comet
using these materials?

00:20:33.850 --> 00:20:36.230
"Yes," Dark says.

00:20:36.810 --> 00:20:39.070
If this is John Doe terrorism,

00:20:39.150 --> 00:20:42.570
they surely hacked the comet's
orbit-correcting function.

00:20:42.650 --> 00:20:46.490
I see. If I can re-hack the main body
with Dark-Bright,

00:20:46.570 --> 00:20:47.990
we can change the orbit.

00:20:48.580 --> 00:20:51.870
But all comm functions are unusable.

00:20:51.950 --> 00:20:52.960
Why?

00:20:53.040 --> 00:20:57.790
All UN2-approved communication
devices can be shut down remotely.

00:20:57.880 --> 00:21:01.000
Damn it! Isn't there any way?

00:21:01.090 --> 00:21:04.590
There has to be a communication device
that isn't UN2-approved.

00:21:04.680 --> 00:21:05.880
CAN BE USED

00:21:05.970 --> 00:21:08.640
Kibo's ICS antenna.

00:21:08.720 --> 00:21:09.720
What is it?

00:21:09.810 --> 00:21:13.270
The antenna that's attached
to the Japanese Module Kibo.

00:21:13.350 --> 00:21:15.440
It was purchased from ISS
for tourism purposes.

00:21:15.520 --> 00:21:19.310
But that's an old antique
that was about to be discarded.

00:21:19.400 --> 00:21:23.320
There's no way it could reach a distance
of 20,000 km with this jamming signal.

00:21:23.400 --> 00:21:27.070
Would it make it
if it was 60 meters ahead?

00:21:27.820 --> 00:21:30.030
It seems Dark has thought of something.

00:21:30.120 --> 00:21:32.830
Please connect me to the ICS antenna.

00:21:33.410 --> 00:21:35.120
Touya, here's a cable.

00:21:35.660 --> 00:21:38.080
What in the world
is that drone planning to do?

00:21:38.170 --> 00:21:40.340
I don't know either.

00:21:41.170 --> 00:21:44.130
According to Dark,
the "S" Pattern and comet

00:21:44.210 --> 00:21:47.300
can communicate with each other
inside of the jamming signal

00:21:47.380 --> 00:21:49.720
since they're using quantum communication.

00:21:49.800 --> 00:21:52.890
Question! What is quantum communication?

00:21:52.970 --> 00:21:57.520
Completely confidential communication tech
established by unknown Seven technology.

00:21:57.600 --> 00:21:58.980
It breaks the Shannon limit

00:21:59.060 --> 00:22:01.770
with its encryption protocol
utilizing entanglement--

00:22:01.860 --> 00:22:03.940
Got it. That's enough.

00:22:04.030 --> 00:22:07.450
Anyhow, that means it can communicate
by mysterious means, right?

00:22:08.450 --> 00:22:12.160
We will interrupt this communication
circuit with the ICS antenna.

00:22:12.240 --> 00:22:14.200
It seems Dark has invented technology

00:22:14.290 --> 00:22:16.830
that can run a quantum communication
on radio waves.

00:22:17.620 --> 00:22:19.830
Dark has already used this circuit

00:22:19.920 --> 00:22:22.960
and connected with the comet once.

00:22:30.010 --> 00:22:31.890
Dark has connected with the comet.

00:22:33.140 --> 00:22:34.220
However,

00:22:34.850 --> 00:22:37.890
although we can connect,
it is using an unknown barrier.

00:22:38.850 --> 00:22:40.940
An unknown barrier?

00:22:41.020 --> 00:22:44.780
The comet's intelligence
has grown beyond prediction.

00:22:44.860 --> 00:22:47.280
It has reached 80% of Seven's.

00:22:48.990 --> 00:22:50.490
Are you okay?

00:22:50.990 --> 00:22:56.370
I heard this voice before
when I was much younger.

00:22:57.750 --> 00:23:02.500
Dark says that this barrier
is the same as Seven's.

00:23:02.580 --> 00:23:03.670
It is impregnable.

00:23:04.290 --> 00:23:06.210
The same as Seven's?

00:23:06.300 --> 00:23:07.710
I remember.

00:23:07.800 --> 00:23:10.800
The "S" in the "S" Pattern
is the "S" in Seven.

00:23:11.640 --> 00:23:15.510
Seven itself
was made from the "S" Pattern.

00:23:15.600 --> 00:23:17.060
Then this comet…

00:23:18.100 --> 00:23:20.310
is Seven itself resurrected?

00:23:20.940 --> 00:23:25.690
"Seven shall become a comet
bearing blessings and be resurrected."

00:23:25.770 --> 00:23:26.610
COMET

00:23:26.690 --> 00:23:27.690
Just like the poem says.

00:23:28.280 --> 00:23:29.570
Dakky, anything yet?

00:23:30.030 --> 00:23:33.240
No. Hacking isn't working.

00:23:33.320 --> 00:23:37.950
That's crazy. Then how on earth did
John Doe manage to change the orbit?

00:23:38.040 --> 00:23:42.420
The comet's AI is thinking autonomously
and determining the trajectory.

00:23:42.500 --> 00:23:45.960
It is using the data from John Doe
and thinking independently.

00:23:46.040 --> 00:23:49.260
As a result,
it selected collision with the Earth.

00:23:49.760 --> 00:23:52.220
So what are we supposed to do?

00:23:52.300 --> 00:23:55.220
We will talk to it and persuade it.

00:23:55.300 --> 00:23:56.970
Something's happening
on the comet's surface.

00:23:57.970 --> 00:24:03.020
The comet's intelligence…
has now surpassed Seven's.

00:24:04.230 --> 00:24:07.480
-It surpassed…
-Seven?

00:24:08.070 --> 00:24:10.400
It's Lunatic. This is the end.

00:24:10.490 --> 00:24:14.110
There's no way we can persuade
a collapsed intelligence.

00:24:14.950 --> 00:24:16.870
Communications are still connected.

00:24:17.530 --> 00:24:19.620
Identifying language system.

00:24:19.700 --> 00:24:21.580
Language identified.

00:24:21.660 --> 00:24:23.370
Learning grammar.

00:24:26.000 --> 00:24:27.460
A response has come.

00:24:28.090 --> 00:24:31.380
We can speak,
though not in a human language.

00:24:32.050 --> 00:24:33.260
We did it.

00:24:33.840 --> 00:24:37.300
We can talk to a Lunatic AI.

00:24:37.390 --> 00:24:41.020
Then perhaps to the implants as well.

00:24:41.100 --> 00:24:42.640
Time's up.

00:24:43.140 --> 00:24:46.350
They just launched a nuclear weapon
at the comet.

00:24:48.110 --> 00:24:53.280
The Anshin and much of the Earth
are going to take a serious EMP hit.

00:24:54.030 --> 00:24:57.450
When that happens,
there will be no hope of a rescue.

00:24:58.450 --> 00:25:02.160
-How many minutes left?
-Twenty seconds.

00:25:02.250 --> 00:25:03.500
Twenty seconds?

00:25:03.580 --> 00:25:07.130
Damn it! There's no time to evacuate.

00:25:07.210 --> 00:25:11.340
The comet has detected the nuclear strike
and is doing something.

00:25:12.800 --> 00:25:13.920
Ten seconds.

00:25:16.510 --> 00:25:20.140
It's okay.
You can see that, can't you, Konoha?

00:25:21.390 --> 00:25:22.430
Nasa.

00:25:26.900 --> 00:25:29.560
Nasa, are you--

00:25:31.400 --> 00:25:32.400
Three,

00:25:32.480 --> 00:25:33.780
two,

00:25:33.860 --> 00:25:34.990
one.

00:25:40.660 --> 00:25:42.290
What happened?

00:25:42.990 --> 00:25:44.910
I'm not dead yet?

00:25:45.870 --> 00:25:48.290
-What about the EMP?
-I can't see it.

00:25:48.380 --> 00:25:51.460
Electrical components operating normally.

00:25:51.540 --> 00:25:53.380
Did the nuclear strike fail?

00:25:54.380 --> 00:25:56.680
This is an optical telescope image.

00:25:57.260 --> 00:26:01.550
According to Dark, the comet hacked
the nuclear weapon and shut it down.

00:26:02.140 --> 00:26:05.140
It hacked UN2's nuclear weapon?

00:26:05.230 --> 00:26:07.270
There's no way it can do that.

00:26:07.350 --> 00:26:11.440
It seems the comet received
a hacking method from somebody.

00:26:11.520 --> 00:26:12.690
What?

00:26:12.770 --> 00:26:14.730
The comet is in great shape.

00:26:14.820 --> 00:26:17.450
Now Dark is using
11th dimension wave function

00:26:17.530 --> 00:26:20.320
to have a heated debate
with the comet's AI.

00:26:20.820 --> 00:26:23.450
It is too advanced
for me to understand, but--

00:26:24.040 --> 00:26:26.910
"Many humans will die
if you collide with Earth.

00:26:27.000 --> 00:26:29.290
I don't want you to kill the humans."

00:26:29.370 --> 00:26:32.460
Do you think it's possible to persuade it
to change its trajectory?

00:26:33.040 --> 00:26:37.470
It seems that the comet is not able
to comprehend the concept of humans.

00:26:38.680 --> 00:26:42.800
Interestingly,
it has a proper concept of humanity.

00:26:42.890 --> 00:26:47.810
But it seems to believe that "humanity"
and "humans" are separate creatures.

00:26:47.890 --> 00:26:49.980
Separate creatures?

00:26:50.060 --> 00:26:53.020
While the comet puts the highest priority
on humanity,

00:26:53.110 --> 00:26:56.480
"humans" outside of that frame
are not given priority.

00:26:56.570 --> 00:27:01.200
Thus the comet thought that 36.79%
of the unimportant humans

00:27:01.280 --> 00:27:03.740
should be exterminated.

00:27:03.830 --> 00:27:05.240
Seven probably does as well.

00:27:05.330 --> 00:27:07.080
Do you foresee us persuading it?

00:27:07.160 --> 00:27:11.370
Dark is currently in the process,
but isn't quite getting the point across.

00:27:11.960 --> 00:27:15.130
However, the comet is incredibly curious.

00:27:15.210 --> 00:27:18.340
Dark guesses that if we gave it
a chance to learn about humans,

00:27:18.420 --> 00:27:21.930
it may be possible to persuade it
to change its trajectory.

00:27:22.010 --> 00:27:24.430
Okay, carry on.

00:27:24.510 --> 00:27:26.010
Aye. Copy.

00:27:26.100 --> 00:27:28.930
I believe that we will succeed
in persuading it soon--

00:27:33.860 --> 00:27:35.820
What are you doing, Nasa?

00:27:39.440 --> 00:27:41.740
Your attention, everyone.

00:27:41.820 --> 00:27:43.450
To tell the truth,

00:27:43.530 --> 00:27:46.990
I'm the one who taught it about
the security hole in the nuclear weapon.

00:27:47.580 --> 00:27:48.620
What?

00:27:48.700 --> 00:27:53.630
Yes, and we must have the comet
stay the course and collide.

00:27:53.710 --> 00:27:56.630
This is stated in the Seven Poem.

00:27:57.420 --> 00:28:00.510
Nasa, what are you saying?

00:28:01.130 --> 00:28:04.550
Ta-da! Now I shall reveal my true self.

00:28:04.640 --> 00:28:07.010
I am a member of John Doe.

00:28:07.100 --> 00:28:10.140
You were the terrorist?

00:28:10.230 --> 00:28:12.980
It's not terrorism. This is a revolution.

00:28:13.560 --> 00:28:15.980
This is to save humanity.

00:28:16.060 --> 00:28:17.770
Ouch!

